    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59422" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοῦ</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κου</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποῦ, που</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοῦα:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνέχυρα</span>, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κουάσαι:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεχυριάσαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοῖον, κῷα</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κούαγμα:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκῆμα</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κούαμα:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλαν</span> (
			Lacon.
		), Id. (fort. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κουάνια </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">῀ ῀κυάνεα</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">:
		μέλανα</span>).</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
